# Exhaustiveness: wildcard arm after complete Int+String coverage is inaccessible.
# [@[Integer String] 42] gives scrutinee typed Union(Int, String).
# Int and String arms exhaust all variants; the wildcard arm is unreachable.
[match [@[Integer String] 42]
    Integer: "int"
    String:  "str"
    _:       "catch"]
=== out
[TypeError] inaccessible match arm: reachable only via diverging (bottom) values
